        "created_at": "2012-03-30T16:15:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So I can infer from your response that the “Deck” and the “Trash” as game terms are distinct and separate entities. (i.e. even though both together comprise the “villain deck” in the physical world) This clears up a lot of oddball cases with the new villains and makes some villains harder (The Chairman) and some easier (Plague Rat).</p>",
