        "created_at": "2012-03-30T18:43:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think if you’re supposed to search the deck and there’s no mention of the trash, then if you don’t find it, you don’t find it and stop. Likewise with the trash.</p>\n<p>Also, the Infection card says what to do if all active heroes are infected – discard the Infection card and play the top card of the villain deck.</p>",
