        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-03-30T19:37:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Deck and Trash are distinct entities.  If you search the Villain Deck and do not find Infection, you simply shuffle the deck and continue as normal; if no Infection is found (and, consequently, no Infection is played), you do not play the next card of the Villain Deck even if all players are Infected.</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
