        "created_at": "2012-03-30T20:53:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There has been some debate about this in the BGG forums actually.  The Operative doesn’t “search the deck”, she reveals cards from the deck until and Underbooss is found.    There is some debate about whether or not revealing cards from a deck would result in shuffling the trash in the same way that drawing from a deck would.  I have a question to Chris about this pending.</p>",
